hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1671.1","Yahya related to me from Malik that Rabia ibn Abi Abd ar-Rahman heard Anas ibn Malik say"
"1671.2","Yahya related to me from Malik that Rabia ibn Abi Abd ar-Rahman heard Anas ibn Malik say"
