"1740.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Suhayl ibn Abi Salih from his father from Abu Hurayra that a man of the Aslam tribe said"
"1741.1","And Mālik narrated to me, from Hishām ibn ‘Urwah, from his father, that the Messenger of Allāh, may Allāh bless him and grant him peace, looked upon Uhud and said: \"This is a mountain that loves us and we love it.\""
"1741.2","Anas ibn Mālik reported that the Messenger of Allāh, may Allāh bless him and grant him peace, said: \"A good dream from a righteous man is a part of forty-six parts of prophethood.\""
