"1748","[1748] On the authority of Aisha, the wife of the Prophet, peace and blessings of God be upon him, that it reached her: That the people of her house were residents in it and with them. Dice, so she sent to them, “If you do not expel her, I will expel you from my house,” and she denied that to them in a manner in front of Malik. Hadith: 1748 Arabic Hadith:"
