"1819.1",""
"1819.2","It was narrated from Safwan ibn Sulaym, that a man said to the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ): \"Should I lie to my wife, O Messenger of Allah?\" The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said: \"There is no good in lying.\" The man said: \"O Messenger of Allah, should I promise her and then say something else?\" The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said: \"There is no sin upon you.\""
